{"pin":"AB00251","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00251","anchor":"","first_line":"O ancient friend and steadfast one in the Covenant! Although for a considerable time, due to numerous obstacles, I have found no opportunity [3.5s]... ...The root cause of wrongdoing is ignorance, and we must therefore hold fast to the tools of perception and knowledge… The subjects to be taught in children's school are many","first_line_orig":"ای یار قدیم ای ثابت بر پیمان اگر چه مدتیست مدید که از کثرت موانع فرصتی نیافتم  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"740","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"music","code":"MANA","source":"MANA","url":"https://manapacifica.bandcamp.com/track/the-divine-foundation"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK3.330.15x","source":"AVK3","locator":"330.15x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK3/ak3-334.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DAK#0970","source":"BRL_DAK","locator":"0970","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/893162690"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MJTB.067x","source":"MJTB","locator":"067x","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2023/05/mjtb.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT1.403","source":"MKT1","locator":"403","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA1/ma1-402.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#111 p.132x","source":"MMK1","locator":"111 p.132x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/578598622"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MNMK#109 p.205","source":"MNMK","locator":"109 p.205","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMAB/mmab-203.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_SOCIAL#191x","source":"BRL_SOCIAL","locator":"191x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/684491283"},{"kind":"translat